{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12105330","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210533001:1":{"text":"そう急ぐな、この先の扉は開かないぜ。","source_cn":"跑慢点，前面的门你们过不去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D603A5350559339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210533002:1":{"text":"なぜ知っている？","source_cn":"你怎么知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x399C303FFEFEBDE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210533003:1":{"text":"見ろよ、これは一方向からしか開かない扉だ。","source_cn":"瞧，这道门是单向门，只能从一边打开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07FD757735139FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210533004:1":{"text":"あんたは開けられるのか？","source_cn":"你会开？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D823720EA012A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210533005:1":{"text":"もちろんだ。","source_cn":"当然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD3748C00199F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210533006:1":{"text":"ならさっさと開けろ。","source_cn":"那就开门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1E444904EB8C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210533007:0":{"text":"その前に縄を解いてもらわなきゃ。","source_cn":"你们得先把我的绳子解开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D60535BF3E5D4B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210533008:1":{"text":"待ってください、まさか私たちを騙して逃げようとしてるんじゃ……","source_cn":"等等，你不会又在骗我们，想趁机逃走吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B4A2521AE348E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210533009:1":{"text":"まさか、俺一人であんたらやマーリン様に太刀打ちできるわけないだろ。","source_cn":"你们这么多人，还有大魔法师梅林在，难道还怕我一个？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB68950FF5E1D5675","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まさか、俺一人であんたらやマーリン様に太刀打ちできるわけないだろ。","female":"まさか、俺一人であんたらやマーリン様に太刀打ちできるわけないだろ。","variant_male_record_index":"130032","variant_female_record_index":"130033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210533010:1":{"text":"この扉を開けられるのは、ブラッディ・マリーの裏切り者か、海のギャングしかいない。","source_cn":"会开这道门的，除了血薇帮的叛徒，就是水鬼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAA3FADD420CCB7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210533011:1":{"text":"あんたはどっちだ？","source_cn":"你又是哪边的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073E082DB96D717C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210533012:1":{"text":"ちょっ、待てって！頼むからその剣を下ろしてくれよ。","source_cn":"哎，哎！朋友，有话好好说，别拿剑吓唬人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC032B80C07EA2DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210533013:0":{"text":"俺みたいな埠頭で食い扶持を稼いでる貧乏人に、雇い主を選べると思うか？それに、ギャングに脅されて断れるわけないだろ！","source_cn":"我这种在码头勉强讨生活的穷人，不可能只有一个雇主。再说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC327F442464223E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210533014:1":{"text":"扉を開けろ。テシオを捉えるのに協力するなら、サメの餌にはしないでおいてやる。","source_cn":"开门，帮我们抓到泰西欧，我可以不把你扔到海里喂鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E78BAC53D18A795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210533015:1":{"text":"分かったから縄を解いてくれ、頼むよ。","source_cn":"我只想拜托你解开绳子，放我自由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB029D02EB2E1B4B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210533016:1":{"text":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","source_cn":"……梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04AAA21E1E034522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","female":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","variant_male_record_index":"130040","variant_female_record_index":"130041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1210533016":{"text":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","source_cn":"……梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04AAA21E1E034522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","female":"……マーリン、あんたはどう思う？","variant_male_record_index":"130040","variant_female_record_index":"130041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210533019:0":{"text":"ふぅ……ありがとよ。すぐに扉を開けてやるから……","source_cn":"呼……感谢。我这就帮你们开门……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E0312D3C5715F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:23:1210532001:":{"text":"んじゃ、お先！","source_cn":"我先走一步啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB5A04945CCBB76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1210534001:0":{"text":"ああ！ほら、やっぱり逃げちゃいましたよ！","source_cn":"辛巴达果然跑了，就知道不能相信他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F01C374A37ADE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210534002:0":{"text":"いや、あれは逃げたのではなく、テシオを追いかけて行ったんだ。","source_cn":"不用追，他不是逃跑，而是去追泰西欧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B6E31FD6F4FCEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210534003:0":{"text":"どうして彼がテシオさんを？何か恨みでもあるんですか……？","source_cn":"为什么他要追泰西欧？他们有仇还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F25791FA510EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1210534004:1":{"text":"端的に言えば、ある。","source_cn":"长话短说：有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A096E8BB8607EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1210534005:1":{"text":"しかも、父親の仇だ。","source_cn":"而且是父仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106755AA3CBECA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210534006:1":{"text":"え？そんなこと、シンドバッドさんは一言も……","source_cn":"哎？从没听他提起过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768BAC019754174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210534007:1":{"text":"少し複雑でな……あとで直接聞くといい。今はあいつを追いかけるぞ。","source_cn":"这事比较复杂，你们以后问他吧，我们先追，别跟丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0611877208BC64D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:35:12010532:0":{"text":"シンドバッドが隠し通路の仕掛け扉を開け、先んじて追いかけていった。","source_cn":"辛巴达帮你们打开密道的机关门，抢先一步追了出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26297F838F44046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"縄を解いてあげよう。","source_cn":"解开吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0516BC46BC1B92","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"縄を解いてあげよう。","female":"縄を解いてあげましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"65550","variant_female_record_index":"65551","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1210533017:0":{"text":"おいおい、頼むよ。テシオに追いつきたいんだろ？俺なら扉を開けられるんだ！","source_cn":"喂喂，拜托，不是还要追泰西欧吗，我真能帮上忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ED88DEACA58208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1210533018:0":{"text":"一度だけチャンスをくれてやる。","source_cn":"我不会再给你第二次机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A074A2A310380CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"もう少し縛っておいた方が……","source_cn":"要不，再绑一会？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40809B712CE8C522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"もう少し縛っておいた方が……","female":"もう少し縛っておいた方が……","variant_male_record_index":"65552","variant_female_record_index":"65553","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text"